{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20507","headline":"送李余及第後归蜀 · 张籍","name":"送李余及第後归蜀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十年人咏好诗章，今日成名出举场。\n归去唯将新诰牒，後来争取旧衣裳。\n山桥晓上芭蕉暗，水店晴看芋草黄。\n乡里亲情相见日，一时携酒贺高堂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20507.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20507","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}